---
import Container from '../../components/Container.astro';
import Prose from '../../components/Prose.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { contactEmail } from '../../config/site';
import { url } from '../../lib/paths';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Alfredo Calendar privacy policy"
  description="Alfredo Calendar privacy policy for the private Alfredo personal assistant."
>
  <Container>
    <article class="max-w-text py-section md:py-section-lg">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="meta text-accent">Alfredo Calendar</p>
        <h1 class="text-h1 text-ink mt-6">Alfredo Calendar privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="meta mt-6">
          Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-13">13 November 2026</time>
        </p>
      </header>
      <Prose>
        <p>
          Alfredo Calendar is operated by João Afonso as part of Alfredo, a private personal
          assistant. It is used with accounts I control or am authorised to connect. It is not a
          public service.
        </p>
        <h2>Google data and its use</h2>
        <p>
          The connection accesses account identity, calendars and events to understand my schedule,
          prepare for commitments and carry out calendar changes I approve. For accounts with Gmail
          enabled, read-only access supports message triage, summaries and suggested replies. It
          does not grant permission to send mail, delete messages or change mailbox state.
        </p>
        <h2>Processing, storage and sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Data needed for an assistant request may be processed by the AI provider configured for
          Alfredo. Requested results may appear in my private assistant interface, including
          Telegram. Relevant, concise knowledge may be saved in my private notes according to the
          assistant&#x27;s rules. These services process data under their respective terms and
          privacy policies.
        </p>
        <p>
          OAuth credentials stay in protected private runtime storage. Credentials and
          non-reconstructible runtime state are included in encrypted backups. Calendar events are
          read from Google rather than mirrored into a separate calendar. Assistant conversations
          and explicitly retained notes may contain information derived from connected accounts.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google account data is not sold, used for advertising, published on this site or made
          available to other site visitors. Alfredo&#x27;s use and transfer of Google API data will
          adhere to the Google API Services User Data Policy, including its Limited Use
          requirements.
        </p>
        <h2>Control and retention</h2>
        <p>
          Access can be revoked in Google Account settings at any time. Revocation stops future
          access; it does not by itself erase prior assistant conversations, notes or encrypted
          backups. Retained information can be removed from the private systems where it was saved,
          subject to their backup retention.
        </p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this connection or retained data can be sent to{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href={url('/alfredo/')}> About Alfredo</a> ·{' '}
          <a href={url('/alfredo/terms/')}> Terms of use</a>
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </article>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
